@maxhsu/dsh-forge README · dsh-forge：> DeepSeek Harness is in developer preview. This plugin is tested with
> `@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools 0.1.7-rc.2`, retains compatibility with the `0.1.0` prereleases from
> `rc.6`, and may need updates when Harness APIs change.

@maxhsu/dsh-forge README · Current scope：The plugin deliberately uses the common REST endpoints instead of instance-specific extensions.
Actions availability depends on the server version and whether Actions is enabled. A future release
can add approval-gated writes, pull-request reviews, artifacts, and webhook-driven workflows.

